WEBVTT

00:16:27.917 --> 00:16:31.268
Da smrtnik otelotvoren u mesu

00:16:31.292 --> 00:16:35.000
neće živeti, voleti ili umreti sam.

00:16:36.708 --> 00:16:38.684
I kad bih znao da pevam,

00:16:38.708 --> 00:16:41.976
kad bismo zapevali zajedno,

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.934
braćo i sestre,

00:16:43.958 --> 00:16:49.292
zasigurno tad ne bismo prestali
da pevamo ovu pesmu nikad.

00:16:50.542 --> 00:16:51.809
Hvala vam.

00:16:51.833 --> 00:16:56.042
(Aplauz)